<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian coffee temperature and rain detailed.</title>
<headline>Brazilian coffee temperature and rain detailed.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian coffee region temperatures (centigrade) and rain (millimeters) in the 72 hours to 1100 GMT.</p>
<p>Parana State: Londrina 19.0, Nil, Maringa 19.4, Nil, Umuarama 18.5, 0.8 mm, Paranavai 19.5, 3.4 mm.</p>
<p>Sao Paulo State: Presidente Prudente 21.6, 0.3 mm, Franca 18.2, 50.6 mm, Votuporanga 20.9, Nil, Catanduva 21.9, Nil, Sao Carlos 19.5, 0.1 mm, Sao Simao 18.6, 0.5 mm.</p>
<p>Minas Gerais State: Pocos de Caldas 16.0, 8.0 mm, Guaxupe 18.0, 61.2 mm.</p>
</text>
